Subject: [PATCH 204/220] [ae-patch] Restore a copied note the iPhone clipboard
 encoded as a URL when it is pasted into the composer

Text that opens with 'WORD: ' can come back from an iPhone clipboard as a lowercased, percent-encoded URL (thread:%20a%0ASTATE:%20b). The composer's paste handler now undoes that exact shape and inserts the decoded text; real URLs and ordinary text paste unchanged.
